===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|scrīptūra||a writing, scripture}}, from {{m|la|scrīptum}}, the supine of {{m|la|scrībō||I write}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# A [[holy text]] considered foundational for a religion

====Usage notes====
Often only used to refer to the foundational text of one's own religion.

===Noun===
